     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">A few years back, <a href=\"https://github.com/chitcode/assignment\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\" style=\"color:rgb(0,89,153)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/chitcode/assignment&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484569318000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-rw4-EssgE35qF3D06WVZ\">Chitrasen</a> managed to use <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);white-space:pre-wrap\">ggvis</code> for PCA - with the significantly higher interactivity available for <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);white-space:pre-wrap\">ggvis</code> I really want to use it going forward. However, I&#39;m unable to locate any information outside of Chitrasen&#39;s code for making this a reality.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">While the model in the link above provides accurately plotted points and scale, vector loading arrows and variable names are missing. I think this must be the result of there not being any equivalent to <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);white-space:pre-wrap\">geom_segment</code> for <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);white-space:pre-wrap\">ggvis</code> yet.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><br></p><p style=\"font-size:15px;clear:both;color:rgb(36,39,41);font-family:Arial,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Helvetica,sans-serif\">I&#39;ve tried splicing in the relevant bits of code from <code style=\"padding:1px 5px;font-size:13px;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);white-space:pre-wrap\">ggbiplot</code> to skirt the issue:</p><pre style=\"padding:5px;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(239,240,241);color:rgb(57,51,24);word-wrap:normal\"><code style=\"font-family:Consolas,Menlo,Monaco,&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,&quot;Liberation Mono&quot;,&quot;DejaVu Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&quot;,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace,sans-serif;white-space:inherit\"><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">nobs.factor </span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\"> sqrt</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">pcobj</span><span style=\"color:rgb(48,51,54)\">$</span><span style=\"